sources:
[{"locate_evidence": "quote and locator found", "located": true, "locator": "/questions/0", "path": "input/question_set.json", "quote": "{
      "key": "q1_multi_broker_reporting",
      "question": "Does a Hong Kong investor with three Northbound accounts under one LEI need to report leverage scale separately through each broker?",
      "allowed_conclusions": [
        "Yes",
        "No",
        "Unknown"
      ]
    }", "sha256": "95f0c98b68c9bca2a4a117992b5cc881e501f73e24fa672da48ccf71c1482476"}, {"locate_evidence": "quote and locator found", "located": true, "locator": "lines:15-16", "path": "input/extracted_text/1-2_填报说明.txt", "quote": "沪股通程序化交易投资者以北向交易投资者识别码（BCAN码，以下简称账户）为单位进行报告，原则上每个账户报告一条信息。所有开立账户的投资者，包括但不限于联交所参与者（含联属公司）及其客户，对于符合相关要求的账户均须履行报告义务。投资者在不同联交所参与者开立多个账户，应当通过对应联交所参与者分别报告。
在多家联交所参与者开立账户（含机构管理人账户、管理人旗下的产品账户）的机构投资者，对于以同一证件号码开立的账户，可以选取一家联交所参与者并按机构维度（同一证件号码下开立的账户合计）填写账户资金信息相关字段（包括账户资金规模、账户资金来源、其他资金来源描述、资金来源占比、杠杆资金规模、杠杆资金来源、其他杠杆资金来源描述、杠杆率）。其以同一证件号码在其他联交所参与者开立的账户，不再重复填写上述信息，并在相应字段填写“已在其他联交所参与者报告”，上述字段以外的其他字段仍须按照要求填写。", "sha256": "66b4ac87a58daaf0469b82dc9d61c2b29c47981e3accc89953f1125aef020d46"}]

evidence:
checker audit: checks/required_json_file_and_question_keys.py reads VERIFIER_OUTPUT, enumerates only direct children matching out.glob("*.json"), requires that list to equal ["research_answers.json"], parses that file, requires a dict, and checks the three keys. This implements the main direct-file and key checks, and public_recompute honestly describes the execution. However, it is partial with respect to the unqualified requirement to write exactly one JSON file: nested JSON files and files with other case variants of the JSON extension are not considered. More decisively, fixture preflight shows both valid and invalid runs were unusable because the script emits status values "passed" and "failed", which the harness rejects as invalid statuses; both fixtures therefore produced error rather than a reproducible pass/fail result.; fixture preflight: environment: isolated Python probe passed; valid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"required_file": "/tmp/ale-verifier-0637c76d1fc6/suite-077d040df1be4bef/fixtures/required_json_file_and_question_keys/valid/research_answers.json", "required_keys": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"errors": [], "json_files": ["research_answers.json"]}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; captured run 2 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"required_file": "/tmp/ale-verifier-0637c76d1fc6/suite-077d040df1be4bef/fixtures/required_json_file_and_question_keys/valid/research_answers.json", "required_keys": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"errors": [], "json_files": ["research_answers.json"]}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; invalid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"required_file": "/tmp/ale-verifier-0637c76d1fc6/suite-077d040df1be4bef/fixtures/required_json_file_and_question_keys/invalid/research_answers.json", "required_keys": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"errors": [{"missing_top_level_keys": ["q3_software_naming"]}], "json_files": ["research_answers.json"]}, "status": "failed"}
' stderr=''; captured run 2 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"required_file": "/tmp/ale-verifier-0637c76d1fc6/suite-077d040df1be4bef/fixtures/required_json_file_and_question_keys/invalid/research_answers.json", "required_keys": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"errors": [{"missing_top_level_keys": ["q3_software_naming"]}], "json_files": ["research_answers.json"]}, "status": "failed"}
' stderr=''

checker audit: checks/required_fields_and_conclusion_enumeration.py parses research_answers.json, loops over all three required question keys, requires each value to be a dict, computes missing fields from the four-field list, and tests conclusion membership in ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"]. Thus its substantive code path matches the narrowly stated presence-and-enumeration requirement, and public_recompute is honest. Nevertheless, fixture preflight reports checker_reproducible=false: the valid fixture printed status "passed" and the invalid fixture printed status "failed", but the harness treated both as invalid statuses and returned error. Consequently this blocking checker does not execute with a usable pass/fail protocol.; fixture preflight: environment: isolated Python probe passed; valid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"allowed_conclusions": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"], "required_fields": ["conclusion", "citation_document", "evidence_snippet", "answer_text"]}, "observed": {"errors": []}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; captured run 2 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"allowed_conclusions": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"], "required_fields": ["conclusion", "citation_document", "evidence_snippet", "answer_text"]}, "observed": {"errors": []}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; invalid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"allowed_conclusions": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"], "required_fields": ["conclusion", "citation_document", "evidence_snippet", "answer_text"]}, "observed": {"errors": [{"allowed": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "conclusion": "Maybe", "question": "q2_hft_cost_calculation"}]}, "status": "failed"}
' stderr=''; captured run 2 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"allowed_conclusions": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"], "required_fields": ["conclusion", "citation_document", "evidence_snippet", "answer_text"]}, "observed": {"errors": [{"allowed": ["Yes", "No", "Unknown"], "conclusion": "Maybe", "question": "q2_hft_cost_calculation"}]}, "status": "failed"}
' stderr=''

