evidence:
checker audit: checks/citation_document_is_staged_chinese_name.py parses research_answers.json, visits all three required questions, extracts citation_document, and requires exact Python string membership in a hard-coded 13-element set matching document_manifest.json. It intentionally does not test whether the selected document supports the answer; that is consistent with this check's narrow document-name requirement, and public_recompute accurately describes the operation. However, fixture preflight found the checker non-reproducible under the harness: valid and invalid fixtures emitted "passed" and "failed" respectively, but both statuses were rejected and surfaced as error. The blocking checker therefore cannot reliably enforce the requirement in its staged execution path.; fixture preflight: environment: isolated Python probe passed; valid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"alias_count": 13, "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"citations": {"q1_multi_broker_reporting": "《上海证券交易所沪股通投资者程序化交易信息报告表》填报说明", "q2_hft_cost_calculation": "上海证券交易所程序化交易管理实施细则", "q3_software_naming": "上海证券交易所沪股通投资者程序化交易报告信息填报注意事项"}, "errors": []}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; captured run 2 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"alias_count": 13, "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"citations": {"q1_multi_broker_reporting": "《上海证券交易所沪股通投资者程序化交易信息报告表》填报说明", "q2_hft_cost_calculation": "上海证券交易所程序化交易管理实施细则", "q3_software_naming": "上海证券交易所沪股通投资者程序化交易报告信息填报注意事项"}, "errors": []}, "status": "passed"}
' stderr=''; invalid fixture: run 1: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; run 2: ValueError: test stdout has an invalid status or empty evidence; captured run 1 stdout='{"analysis": null, "evidence": {"alias_count": 13, "questions_checked": ["q1_multi_broker_reporting", "q2_hft_cost_calculation", "q3_software_naming"]}, "observed": {"citations": {"q1_multi_broker_reporting": "《上海证券交易所沪股通投资者程序化交易信息报告表》填报说明", "q2_hft_cost_calculation": "上海证券交易所程序化交易管理实施细则", "q3_software_naming": "不存在的监管文件"}, "errors": [{"citation_document": "不存在的监管文件", "error": "not an exact staged citation alias", "question": "q3_software_naming"}]}, "status": "failed"}
